Z||000000||Seanh||05-30-2001||07:28 PM||||What should a stock 87 GT 2.8L V6 with a stock auto tranny do, 0-60 in? I had mine out on a road last night, and couldn't pull anything better then 10.5 seconds. I know it should be faster then that, so somthing is wrong with that damn engine. I am replacing fuel injectors on it, so this could be the problem. Thanks||||reg||1
