Z||000003||Slammed Fiero||05-30-2001||07:35 PM||||10.5?? Get it checked out for probs , should be high 8's low 9's at worst.<P>I pulled 10.3's in Fierolisa's Old 86 Coupe 4cyl 5spd with a GTEC , this was with 2 people in 90+ degree weather .<P>GTECS are very accurate , I have used 3 units and I always get 0 to 60 times with my car within .2-.3 secs. I had a friend run one @ the strip , it was nearly identical to the timer at the drag strip<P>------------------<BR>      <IMG SRC="http://albums.photopoint.com/j/View?u=1607505&a=12259132&p=48230089&Sequence=0&res=high">      <BR>Jonathan McCreery<BR>86 GT 4spd<BR>Koni's , Coilovers, Big Bars , 17" Trmotorsports Typhoons , 11.25" vented discs, Wilwood 4 Piston Calipers , Pirelli P Zero's, Short Shift, No cat , Cold air induction , Geni Stainless tips, White face gauges , Momo shift , momo pedals..Autocrossed , Tracked , abused.<p>[This message has been edited by Slammed Fiero (edited 05-30-2001).]||||reg||1
